    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ămĭtīnus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		amita, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>descended from a father's sister;</i> hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ămĭtī-ni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ămĭtīnae</span></b> ,
				ārum, f., <i>cousins</i>, <i>cousins-german</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 38,
				10, 1</span></i> and 10.</div>
